---
import type { Lang } from "../../lib/i18n";
import { local } from "./shared";
interface Props {
  lang: Lang;
}
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const t = local(lang);
---

<section data-demo="superpowers" lang={lang}>
  <header>
    <p class="eyebrow">
      {t(
        "Recipe app · illustrated test-first repair",
        "레시피 앱 · 테스트 우선 수정 예시",
        "レシピアプリ · テスト先行の修正例",
      )}
    </p>
    <h2>
      {t(
        "Observe failure. Repair. Review.",
        "실패 확인 → 수정 → 검토",
        "失敗を確認 → 修正 → レビュー",
      )}
    </h2>
  </header>
  <div class="formula" data-expected>
    <p>{t("Agreed behavior", "합의한 동작", "合意した動作")}</p>
    <strong>200 g × 2 / 4 = 100 g</strong>
    <span>
      {t("Four servings → two servings", "4인분 → 2인분", "4人分 → 2人分")}
    </span>
  </div>
  <div class="bench">
    <article class="failure" data-test-failure>
      <h3>01 / {t("Failing test", "실패하는 테스트", "失敗するテスト")}</h3>
      <p class="output">✕ 200 g</p>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Observed result differs from the expected 100 g",
          "관찰 결과가 예상한 100 g과 다름",
          "観察結果が期待する100 gと異なる",
        )}
      </p>
    </article>
    <div class="repair">
      <b>02</b>
      <p>
        {t("Fix the scaling calculation", "배율 계산 수정", "倍率の計算を修正")}
      </p>
      <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
    </div>
    <article class="pass" data-test-pass>
      <h3>03 / {t("Passing test", "통과하는 테스트", "通過するテスト")}</h3>
      <p class="output">✓ 100 g</p>
      <p>
        {t(
          "Rerun the test and relevant checks",
          "테스트와 관련 점검 재실행",
          "テストと関連確認を再実行",
        )}
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <p class="review" data-review>
    04 /{" "}
    {t(
      "Review against the plan and check other agreed quantities",
      "계획과 대조해 검토·다른 합의된 재료량 점검",
      "計画と照合してレビュー・他の合意した分量も確認",
    )}
  </p>
  <p class="boundary" data-boundary>
    {t(
      "Illustrated procedure, not an executed test. Harness setup and skill activation must be checked; existing project limits still apply.",
      "실행한 테스트가 아닌 절차 예시입니다. 에이전트 설정·스킬 활성화를 확인하고 기존 프로젝트 제한을 지킵니다.",
      "実行済みテストではなく手順の例です。環境設定・スキル有効化を確認し、既存の制限を守ります。",
    )}
  </p>
</section>
<style>
  section {
    container-type: inline-size;
    padding: clamp(18px, 4vw, 34px);
    background: #172636;
    color: #f2f5fa;
    border: 1px solid #687d90;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.5;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
  p,
  h2,
  h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }
  h2,
  h3 {
    color: inherit;
  }
  h2 {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 1.8rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  h3 {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 650;
    color: #c7d8e7;
  }
  .formula {
    margin-top: 22px;
    border-left: 4px solid #f7ca7d;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 5px;
  }
  .formula p,
  .formula span {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }
  .formula strong {
    font:
      700 clamp(1.2rem, 3vw, 1.65rem) ui-monospace,
      monospace;
    color: #ffddaa;
  }
  .bench {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.6fr 1fr;
    gap: 16px;
    margin-top: 24px;
  }
  article {
    border: 2px solid;
    padding: 18px;
    min-width: 0;
  }
  .failure {
    border-color: #eda9ae;
    background: #3c2534;
  }
  .pass {
    border-color: #a5dab8;
    background: #193d34;
  }
  article p:last-child {
    font-size: 0.86rem;
  }
  .output {
    font:
      800 clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2rem) ui-monospace,
      monospace;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }
  .failure .output {
    color: #ffd1d4;
  }
  .pass .output {
    color: #c4f7d7;
  }
  .repair {
    align-self: center;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .repair b {
    color: #ffddaa;
  }
  .repair span {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
  }
  .review {
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding: 14px;
    border: 1px dashed #a9bdd0;
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .boundary {
    margin-top: 18px;
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    color: #d2dfeb;
  }
  @container (max-width: 610px) {
    .bench {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .repair {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .repair span {
      transform: rotate(90deg);
    }
  }
</style>
